SECTION A — EXECUTIVE SUMMARY
This is an institutional-grade, multi-asset algorithmic trading platform targeting Indian equity/options markets (NSE/BSE via AngelOne) and BTC crypto derivatives (Binance, Delta Exchange). Built as a polyglot monorepo: Go engine, Next.js frontend/BFF, Python AI service.

The platform demonstrates sophisticated engineering in its core trading pipeline — event sourcing, multi-gate risk enforcement, state-machine OMS, and a 387-strategy registry with WINNERS_ONLY gatekeeping. However, critical operational gaps exist that preclude production deployment: hardcoded credentials in Docker Compose, no offsite database backups, a reconciliation system with no auto-repair, a potential AI bridge execution bypass of risk gates, and unauthenticated engine proxy routes.

Overall Production Readiness: 61/100

