SECTION R — AI HANDOVER DOCUMENT
Application Overview
Antigravity is an autonomous algorithmic trading platform for BTC crypto derivatives and Indian equity/options markets. It operates 387+ strategies simultaneously in a paper trading environment ($1M paper account) with live market data. The platform is designed to eventually support live execution on Binance (BTC futures), Delta Exchange (BTC options), and AngelOne (NSE/NIFTY).

Business Objectives
Paper-trade 387 strategies simultaneously against live BTC-USD and NIFTY price feeds
Rank strategies by Sharpe ratio, profit factor, and expectancy; retain only winners (WINNERS_ONLY gate)
Provide institutional-grade risk enforcement before any capital commitment
Support AI-assisted signal generation with human approval before live execution
Target institutional readiness score ≥90/100 before live capital deployment
Architecture for Continuity
Entry Point: engine/cmd/antigravity/main.go — 2,329 lines. Boots engine, spawns 17+ goroutines, serves HTTP on :8080.

Critical Packages (Go):

engine/internal/trading/loop.go — executeThroughInstitutionalPath() is the core execution function. All 4 risk gates are here.
